sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Event Organizer
  participant S as EventSafe System
  actor C as Compliance Officer
  participant A as Audit Log

  O->>S: View custom risk conditions
  S->>C: Notify pending items
  C->>S: Confirm legal compliance
  S->>A: Write verification record
  S->>O: Request item-by-item acknowledgement
  O->>S: Acknowledge risk conditions
  S->>A: Write acknowledgement record

  alt All signatures present
    S->>S: Mark as released
    S->>A: Record release event
  else Missing signature
    S-->>O: Block release and indicate missing signature
  end
